sequenceDiagram
    %% ============================================================
    %% v10 R2 时序图：覆盖 4 个变更的关键调用链
    %% 类 / 函数名均来自 v10_scoring_admin_incremental_design_r2.md
    %% ============================================================

    box rgb(235,245,255) 变更 A · 评分引擎 v2 + Q10 归一化（黄金用例）
        participant Lost as LostItem(失物)
        participant Found as FoundItem(候选)
        participant MS as MatchService
        participant CF as ColorFamily
        participant SR as ScoringRefs
        participant SET as Settings
        participant MO as MatchOut
    end

    Note over Lost,MO: 失物 "一串黑色钥匙，教学楼四楼402掉落" → W_provided=80, k=1.25
    Lost->>MS: extract_features(lost, is_lost=True)
    MS->>SR: ROOM_RE / LOCATION_LEVELS / STATE_WORDS / STOPWORDS_V2
    SR-->>MS: place={楼:教学楼,层:四楼,房:402}, qty={(1,串)}, colors={黑系}, states=∅, keywords=∅
    MS->>MS: _feature_cache[(lost,id)] = ItemFeatures
    Lost->>MS: score_detail(lost, found, exact_category)
    MS->>MS: photo_category_score() → 20
    MS->>MS: qty_score() → 15 / 5 / ...
    MS->>CF: color_families_of(lost.features) / color_families_of(found.features)
    CF-->>MS: family_score() → 20 / 10 / 0
    MS->>MS: state_score() / place_score() / keyword_score()
    MS->>SET: MATCH_W2_TIME / MATCH_TIME_TAU_DAYS
    MS->>MS: time_score() = 10·exp(-Δd/15)
    MS->>MS: _provided_weight(lost) → 80
    MS->>SET: MATCH_NORM_MIN_WEIGHT (=50.0)
    MS->>MS: k = 100 / max(80, 50) = 1.25   %% 铁律：k 只由失主侧决定
    MS->>MS: total = clamp(raw_total * 1.25, 0, 100)
    MS-->>Found: score_detail = {photo_category,qty,color,state,place,keyword,signals,raw_total,norm_factor=1.25,provided_dims,text,location,time,total}
    MS->>MO: build_match_outs(...) 透传全部新字段
    Note right of MS: 候选 A: raw=45 → total=56.25 (<60 落入弱化区)<br/>候选 B: raw=69 → 86.25 (疑似)<br/>候选 C: raw=78 → 97.5 (疑似)
    end

    box rgb(255,245,235) 变更 B · 候选排序修正（疑似全列）
        participant PS as PublishService
        participant Scored as scored[(-score,id)]
    end

    Lost->>PS: _reverse_match_lost(lost)
    PS->>MS: score(lost, f, exact) 对每条召回候选
    MS-->>PS: (total, found) 已排序
    PS->>PS: _cut_with_suspects(scored, MATCH_TOP_N)
    Note over PS: n=10; while scored[n]>=MATCH_THRESHOLD(80): n++<br/>cap = max(MATCH_TOP_N, MATCH_SUSPECT_MAX=50)<br/>return scored[:min(n,cap)]
    PS-->>Lost: 前 10 保底 + 其后所有 ≥80（黄金用例含 B、C）

    Note over PS: _reverse_match_found 改造 B-2：先 score 再判<br/>if existing>=TOP_N and s<80: continue (不打扰)<br/>keep1 早退(L368-369) 与 _recall 无 keep_status 过滤 不得动(G-1)

    box rgb(235,255,235) 变更 C · 管理员注册（邀请码）
        participant LV as LoginView.vue
        participant API as /auth/register
        participant AUTH as AuthService
        participant CS as compare_digest
        participant DB as DB(User)
        participant AUD as write_audit
    end

    LV->>API: register(UserCreate{..., admin_code?})
    API->>AUTH: register(data)
    AUTH->>SET: ADMIN_APPLY_CODE
    AUTH->>CS: compare_digest(supplied, expected) & bool(expected)
    CS-->>AUTH: is_admin
    AUTH->>DB: role = 1 if is_admin else 0
    AUTH->>AUD: write_audit(action="register_admin")  %% commit 前，同事务
    AUTH->>DB: commit()
    AUTH-->>API: (user, token)  token 已透传 role
    Note right of AUTH: 错码/不填 → role=0，响应体完全一致(AC-C9)<br/>ADMIN_APPLY_CODE 空串 → bool(expected)=False 防越权

    box rgb(245,235,255) 变更 D · 后台详情 + 多格式导出 + all_time
        participant ADM as AdminRouter
        participant EXP as AdminExportService
        participant CLN as CleanupService
        participant RES as Response(blob)
    end

    ADM->>ADM: GET /admin/matches?all_time=true
    Note over ADM: all_time=True → 跳过 expires_at>now-270d 两个 filter
    ADM->>ADM: GET /admin/matches/{id}/detail
    ADM->>EXP: build_conversation_rows(db, match_id)
    EXP-->>ADM: [AdminConversationItem]  → AdminMatchDetailOut
    ADM->>EXP: POST /admin/export {ids, scope, format}
    alt format = xlsx
        EXP->>EXP: 惰性 import openpyxl (失败→400 code 9001)
        EXP->>EXP: Workbook 双 Sheet + 首行加粗 + freeze_panes
        EXP-->>RES: application/vnd...sheet
    else format = md
        EXP->>EXP: 纯 f-string 拼装（转义 | 与换行）
        EXP-->>RES: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
    else format = csv
        EXP-->>RES: text/csv（兼容 v7 行为）
    end
    ADM->>CLN: ADMIN_RETENTION_DAYS = settings.ADMIN_RETENTION_DAYS (默认 270)
    Note over CLN: 类属性形态不变；从不清理 audit_log（天然长期留存）
